{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":62468,"duration_api_ms":61850,"num_turns":19,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md` in place. I didn't build any lessons, and some details come from directory listings and file reads only. These include the lesson groupings and the `generate_toc.py` and `.config` behaviour.\n\n**Fixes to the old version**\n- Removed the unverified `cargo build` instructions for lesson 37. I found no Rust project files there.\n- Replaced \"each tutorial has its own Makefile\" with the real split. 26 lessons have Makefiles. Lessons 1-10 use eunomia-bpf (`ecc` and `ecli`), and the Go and Rust lessons follow their READMEs.\n- Corrected the lesson groupings, which were partly wrong.\n\n**Additions**\n- The `git submodule update --init --recursive` step needed before any build.\n- The `make -C src/<N>-<name>` build command, the `V=1` verbose flag, and the master `src/Makefile`.\n- How CI \"tests\" lessons: it builds them and runs `sudo timeout -s 2 3`, treating exit 124 as success.\n- The build pipeline, and the fact that each lesson's Makefile is its own copy of the template.\n- The bilingual README convention, the `.config` `level=` field, and the `guideline_*.md` write-up templates.\n\nI also noticed that `.gitmodules` lists only `blazesym` and `bpftool`, not `libbpf`. I left that out of the file, so check whether it's intentional.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3dca30a7-e005-4227-ab70-c16ecda08d34","total_cost_usd":0.30434295,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20275,"cache_read_input_tokens":385399,"output_tokens":7508,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":20275},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":481,"cache_read_input_tokens":44076,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m